# Enterprise AI Knowledge Base & Customer Support Assistant

An enterprise-focused AI knowledge assistant built with Java,
Spring Boot, Spring AI, RAG, vector search, and LLM integration.

## Overview

The Enterprise AI Knowledge Base & Customer Support Assistant
allows administrators to upload enterprise documents and enables
authenticated users to ask natural-language questions about the
available knowledge base.

The system uses Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to retrieve
relevant information from the knowledge base before generating
an answer using a Large Language Model (LLM).

## Objectives

- Build a production-oriented Java + AI application.
- Implement secure authentication and authorization.
- Process and index enterprise documents.
- Implement semantic/vector search.
- Implement Retrieval-Augmented Generation.
- Provide conversational AI functionality.
- Provide API documentation.
- Implement automated testing.
- Containerize the application using Docker.
- Implement Continuous Integration using GitHub Actions.

