components for authentication, document management, AI processing,
vector search, and conversational functionality.

Detailed architecture documentation is maintained under:

`docs/architecture/`

## RAG Pipeline

The planned Retrieval-Augmented Generation pipeline is:

```text
Document
    ↓
Text Extraction
    ↓
Text Chunking
    ↓
Embedding Generation
    ↓
Vector Storage
    ↓
User Question
    ↓
Similarity Search
    ↓
Relevant Context
    ↓
Prompt Construction
    ↓
LLM
    ↓
Generated Response